DP: dp[i][j] = length ending at s[i-1], t[j-1]. Reset to 0 on mismatch. Track max.

```python
def lcs_substring(s, t):
    m, n = len(s), len(t)
    best = 0
    dp = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)]
    for i in range(1, m + 1):
        for j in range(1, n + 1):
            if s[i-1] == t[j-1]:
                dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j-1] + 1
                best = max(best, dp[i][j])
    return best
```

