For min falling path sum I will sweep row by row.

```python
def falling(grid):
    n = len(grid)
    dp = list(grid[0])
    for i in range(1, n):
        new = [0] * n
        for j in range(n):
            best = dp[j]
            if j > 0: best = min(best, dp[j-1])
            if j < n - 1: best = min(best, dp[j+1])
            new[j] = grid[i][j] + best
        dp = new
    return min(dp)
